@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title voime-gpu-common：daemon 与 GPU worker 的帧协议

participant "voimed（daemon）" as Daemon
participant "GPU worker" as Worker

Daemon --> Worker : spawn（model_dir / device）
Daemon -> Worker : Hello { protocol, backend, model_dir, device }
Worker --> Daemon : Ready { protocol, backend, runtime, device, vram_mb, punc }
Daemon -> Worker : Transcribe { id, sample_rate, language } + PCM
Worker -> Worker : 内部处理
Worker --> Daemon : Result { id, text, latency_ms, rtf }
Daemon -> Worker : Transcribe { id, sample_rate, language } + PCM
Worker --> Daemon : Error { id, code, message }
Daemon -> Worker : Shutdown
Worker --> Daemon : Bye

note over Daemon, Worker
  Ready 表示加载完成；Result 与 Error 是 Transcribe 的二选一终态。
  Hello → Ready 120 s；Transcribe → 终态 60 s；Shutdown → Bye 5 s。
  Cancel 不引入新的响应类型；关闭超时由 daemon 强杀 worker。
end note
@enduml
